# DRIVEMITRA
# USER MANAGEMENT, ROLE LOGIC, SUBSCRIPTIONS & BUSINESS RULES

## 1. OBJECTIVE

Implement and verify the complete business logic of DriveMitra.

This specification covers:

1. Fleet Owner account.
2. Staff account.
3. Driver account.
4. Platform Administrator.
5. Role-based access control.
6. Staff permission management.
7. Driver operational restrictions.
8. Two subscription plans.
9. Subscription activation.
10. Payment verification.
11. Subscription renewal and expiration.
12. Organisation-level data isolation.
13. Notifications and account lifecycle.
14. Cross-module business rules.
15. Complete testing and validation.

This must integrate with the existing DriveMitra application.

Do not create a separate, disconnected user-management or subscription system.

Inspect the existing database, authentication, payment logic and frontend before making changes.

Preserve existing records and working functionality.

