| Dashboard | View |
| Live Monitoring | View |
| Vehicles | Add and Edit |
| Drivers | Add and Edit |
| Staff | No Access |
| Trip Planning | Add and Edit |
| Vehicle Assignment | Add and Edit |
| Meter History | Add and Edit |
| Tyre Readings | No Access |
| Expense History | No Access |
| Replacement Analysis | No Access |
| Tools & Equipment | Add, Edit and Maintain |
| Inspections | No Access |
| Issues | Add and Edit |
| Reminders | No Access |
| Maintenance | View and Maintain |
| Work Orders | View and Maintain |
| Contacts | No Access |
| Vendors | No Access |
| Parts & Inventory | No Access by default |
| Fuel History | View |
| Charging History | View |
| Places | View |
