Additional restrictions:

- Staff cannot delete vehicles by default.
- Staff cannot delete drivers by default.
- Staff cannot cancel or delete assignments by default.
- Staff cannot delete work orders by default.
- Staff cannot approve contract amendments by default.
- Staff cannot change contract rental rates by default.
- Staff cannot release deposits by default.
- Staff cannot modify sensitive bank information by default.
- Staff cannot access subscription management.
- Staff cannot manage organisation ownership.
- Staff cannot access Integrations.

The permission system must allow explicit exceptions when the owner authorises them.

## 3.3 Staff data restrictions

Staff may only access:
- Their organisation's records.
- Records permitted by their role.
- Records within their assigned responsibilities, where assignment restrictions are configured.

For example:

A staff member authorised to maintain vehicles can update vehicle information.

That does not automatically grant permission to view bank details or approve vehicle loan payments.

## 3.4 Staff activity tracking

Record:
- Staff ID.
- Action.
- Module.
- Record ID.
- Previous value where appropriate.
- New value where appropriate.
- Timestamp.
- Device/session information where appropriate.

The Fleet Owner must be able to review staff activity.

