- Both plans provide identical product features.
- Do not introduce Starter, Growth or Enterprise subscription tiers.
- Do not impose arbitrary vehicle limits.
- Do not impose arbitrary driver limits.
- Do not impose artificial staff limits.
- Do not restrict modules based on subscription plan.
- Do not create hidden premium features.
