# FINAL IMPLEMENTATION INSTRUCTION

The purpose of this specification is to make DriveMitra behave like a real subscription-based fleet management business.

The Fleet Owner owns and manages the organisation.

Staff operate the modules and workflows the owner permits.

Drivers perform authorised driving and operational tasks through the mobile application.

The Platform Administrator manages the DriveMitra platform, subscriptions and integrations.

There are exactly two active subscription plans:

MONTHLY — ₹3,500/month.

ANNUAL — ₹36,000/year.

Both plans must provide identical functionality without artificial vehicle, driver or staff limits.

Implement the complete lifecycle from registration to subscription activation, organisation management, staff and driver access, daily fleet operations, renewal and expiration.

Do not implement only the screens.

Implement the actual business rules, backend validation, database relationships, permissions, payment verification and complete workflows.

Preserve existing DriveMitra functionality and data.

Do not mark a feature complete until it has been tested.